  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to Justice for Children-    Strengthening Justice and Child Protection Systems in PNG</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project builds on the previous strategic framework of the Access to Justice for Children and Women Project (2018-2023), in PNG.

It covers building an enabling environment through developing policies, national action plans, and evidence generation, system strengthening, capacity building, and service provision for children in contact with the law, working with government agencies, service providers, the police, and courts for child-friendly justice, service delivery, and birth registration.</narrative>
  </description>
